      "writtenOn": "2023-02-06T23:00:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "unfortunately yes, I ran into issues in presumbit for some code coverage enabled branch where the ninja file referenced some bazel output files that can\u0027t be found, I think the code coverage argument will affect the the naming of the output files in bazel, so cquery and aquery need to have the same applicable configs, otherwise the names can be out of sync, for example the below error bothered me for a while and went away after I made this change:\n\nFAILED: ninja: \u0027out/bazel/output/execroot/__main__/bazel-out/cf_x86_64_phone-userdebug_android_x86_silvermont-opt-ST-3d29faa6f04b/bin/external/libcxx/liblibc++_toc.so.toc\u0027, needed by \u0027out/soong/.intermediates/system/libbase/libbase/android_x86_silvermont_shared_cov_apex31/unstripped/libbase.so\u0027, missing and no known rule to make it\n00:34:59 ninja failed with: exit status 1",
      "parentUuid": "a9fd2d36_e27ad87b",
