      "writtenOn": "2023-02-06T21:36:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "+1 \n\nIt may also help to extract this into a separate function that checks if mixed builds are compatible with the enabled sanitizers as this now seems to go beyond the ubsanEnabled variable name. That may also help clarify whether it is necessary and whether we have the correct logic. \n\nMy understanding from http://b/266970090 was that the issue is more about the propagation of sanitizer enablement, which may mean that this check is insufficient for the cases that may cause errors.",
      "parentUuid": "bc2fb78d_faada1f2",
      "revId": "0903527e51602dd99c0e628840a9ebf03f2be07f",
