      "message": "yeah, this is to disable mixed build for this cc module only if ubsan is enabled in a asan variant, I thought this was what we discussed the other day with Trevor, but maybe this check is not correct? DCLA will needs this since libbase will be disabled in an apex variant otherwise as it has ubsan enabled.",
